$$

Use the angle between two lines formula:

$$
\tan \theta = \left| \frac{m_t - m_f}{1 + m_t m_f} \right|
$$

Let’s compute both sides for $\theta = 45^\circ \Rightarrow \tan 45 = 1$, so:

$$
1 = \left| \frac{2x_0 - m_f}{1 + 2x_0 m_f} \right|
$$

But recall:

$$
m_f = \frac{x_0^2 - \frac{1}{4}}{x_0}
$$

Now plug into the expression.

---

